      "id": "claim_73992312dea446258f34d876111439a0",
      "statement": "Session.fromPartition maps an empty partition to the default session, a 'persist:' prefix to an on-disk context, and any other name to an in-memory context; fromPath requires a non-empty absolute path; CreateFrom reuses an existing wrapper, calls JS _init, and emits 'session-created' on app.",
