      "statement": "ProtocolRegistry keeps per-context maps of registered handlers and intercept handlers (registration fails if the scheme already exists), adds an ElectronURLLoaderFactory per registered scheme, and when the grant_file_protocol_extra_privileges fuse is on replaces the file: factory with an AsarURLLoaderFactory.",
